Dear Editors,

Attached is a press release concerning the submission of the =E2=80=9CNationa=
l Languages (Official Status) Bill, 2025=E2=80=9D to the Zambian National Ass=
embly. The bill, authored by Major Dr. Kabanga Allan, seeks to establish Bemb=
a and Lozi as co-official languages of the Republic of Zambia based on extens=
ive linguistic census data.

We kindly request your consideration for publication and national disseminati=
on. Interviews and background briefings are available upon request.

Warm regards, =20
